;-------------------------------------------------------------------
;  Revision History:             
;
;   REV      DATE    WHO    ER#   DESCRIPTION OF CHANGE
;--------  --------  ---  ------  --------------------------------------------
; 2.00.00  07-13-15  GTH  xxxxxx  Initial version for Qlipper (based on Baker 1.0.D.0)
; 2.00.01  07-14-15  DM   134839  Enable PCIe Gen2 and Gen3
; 2.01.00  07-20-15  PAS  xxxxxx  Enable MPI.
; 2.01.01  11-24-15  DM   138025  TXCDR Polarity=0,No post cursor
; 2.01.02  11-24-15  PAS  138130  Enable VDM over PCIe
; 2.01.03  12-16-15  PAS  138315  Initialize MPI/Driver Communication Area
; 2.01.04  03-01-16  DM   138814  Mask Interrupt on PCS RX Parity Error
; 2.01.05  05-12-16  DM   138325  Enable PEP FW rate change processing to set TXCDR Polarity=0 for Gen1/Gen2, and 1 for Gen3
; 2.01.06  05-16-16  PAS  139162  Enable Cold/Warm Boot Detection for non-MPI adapters.
; 2.01.07  10-24-16  DM   140439  Set Power On LED Scheme,all 3 Green LEDs On.
; 2.01.08  04-06-17  DM   141544  Allow MPI autoload on soft reset
; 2.01.09  01-16-19  PAS  145219  Use Preload Function 514 to set feature requests for VDM.
;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

